{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30608","headline":"和主司王起 · 石贯","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重德由来爲国生，五朝清显冠公卿。\n风波久伫济川檝，羽翼三迁出谷莺。\n绦帐青衿同日贵，春兰秋菊异时荣。\n孔门弟子皆贤哲，谁料穷儒忝一名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"石贯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}